#252
The Nave of Unfinished Saints~
Rows of shattered pews march toward a distant altar beneath a vaulted
ceiling open to the stars. Along the aisle stand statues of saints, each
with its face still uncarved, waiting for a sculptor to decide who they
will become.
~
